1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:06,300
Traffic violations happen in seconds, but documenting them, that can take much longer.

2
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:10,840
Paperwork, manual calculations, delayed records.

3
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:16,600
In a world that is becoming more digital, we ask ourselves one question.

4
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:19,360
Why not make traffic ticketing smarter?

5
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:23,240
That question inspired us.

6
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:28,200
We are MiJoRi Tech, and we're introducing our very own innovation.

7
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:35,580
LTO Officer, a mobile-based traffic violation ticketing system designed to bring convenience,

8
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:39,280
accuracy, and efficiency into one application.

9
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:44,480
One application, essential tools, right at your fingertips.

10
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:48,260
With officer login and easy to navigate dashboard,

11
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:53,480
our application brings the ticketing process together in one place.

12
00:00:54,410 --> 00:00:58,790
Creating a traffic ticket is more convenient with our application.

13
00:00:59,970 --> 00:01:07,010
Officers can enter the violator's information, select an address and record vehicle details through guided steps.

14
00:01:07,950 --> 00:01:12,710
We also included input validations to help minimize encoding errors.

15
00:01:13,390 --> 00:01:22,730
To support proper documentation, we integrated a camera feature that allows officers to capture photo evidence directly within the application.

16
00:01:23,350 --> 00:01:29,990
We also included location functionality, allowing GPS information to be attached when available.

17
00:01:31,270 --> 00:01:33,530
Bringing innovation to traffic enforcement.

18
00:01:34,490 --> 00:01:36,750
Smarter enforcement, safer roads.

19
00:01:38,423 --> 00:01:44,523
Violation and fines. One of the key features we develop is our violation selection system.

20
00:01:45,383 --> 00:01:53,083
Officers can select the applicable traffic violations and our applications automatically calculates the corresponding total fines.

21
00:01:53,863 --> 00:01:58,083
This reduces the manual compensation during the ticket preparation.

22
00:01:59,243 --> 00:02:01,563
And second is the digital traffic ticket.

23
00:02:02,403 --> 00:02:07,843
After completing the required information, our application generates a digital traffic violation ticket.

24
00:02:08,583 --> 00:02:14,823
Each ticket includes a unique reference number and QR code to support organized or record management.

25
00:02:15,803 --> 00:02:17,483
And last is the offline capability.

26
00:02:18,263 --> 00:02:21,983
We also designed our application with offline first functionality.

27
00:02:23,243 --> 00:02:28,303
Traffic ticket records can be saved locally when the internet connectivity is unavailable

28
00:02:28,303 --> 00:02:32,103
and synchronized with a server once the connection is explored.
